Investigators collected CCTV footage from the various locations Hannah's mobile phone was pinged on the night of March 14. As the audio recording of her 999 call had indicated she was being driven in a van, they were on the lookout for any matching vehicles travelling in those areas at the exact time Hannah's mobile phone was positioned to there. A total of seven different vans were sighted in the CCTV footage, prompting investigators to begin the task of identifying each of the vehicle's owners. Given the suspected killer had what sounded like a South Asian accent, they were confident

