the man they were looking for was not originally from the United Kingdom. On March 26, 10 days after Hannah's body had been found, BBC television show Crime Watch aired a segment about the case, reenacting the teenage's last known movements and appealing for assistance to identify her killer. Hillary and Trevor Foster made an appearance on the show to voice their torment, with Hillary explaining, quote, It's the not knowing what she's been through, and to just knowing how frightened she must have been at some stage, and we can't get beyond that.

