00:25:29.000 --> 00:26:09.000
The couple had two sons, a six-year-old and a four-year-old. It didn't appear to be a happy marriage, with neighbors overhearing the couple fired often, describing Coley as a drunk and self-confessed gambling addict. Police were able to locate Coley's wife Shalinda and their two children, who were staying at her parents' house nearby. She explained her husband had travelled back to India to look after his mother, who was in a coma after being hit by a bus. While she refused to believe her husband could be responsible for such a heinous crime, Shalinda

