in the world meant carrying out the arrest would be no easy task. On the morning of Friday, April 11, a statement was released by the Foster family ahead of Hannah's funeral service which was scheduled to take place later that day. The statement read, Today, family and friends are joining together to give thanks for the life of Hannah. Nothing can bring our beautiful daughter back to us, and today will not be easy for any of us, but we will find strength in each other and strength in the continued support given to us by members of the community in Southampton and beyond.

